Corrected message:

Keep palette size when the Resize Palette row reset is declined

The dialog rounds its palette-size and recent-colors fields down to fit
whichever row count is selected. Those rounded values were applied
even when the user then declined the palette-reset prompt, so the rows
stayed the same but the palette size and recent-color count shrank
(e.g. 8 recent colors became 6). Declining the reset now keeps the
palette size and recent-color count the palette had before the
dialog.
